                            <comment id="16667073" author="slukyanov" created="Mon, 29 Oct 2018 11:55:43 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;The issue is caused by the fact that with BLT lost partitions stay on the offline nodes.&lt;br/&gt;
It looks like GridDhtPartitionTopologyImpl only marks partitions as LOST on non-local online servers. When we have no non-local online servers, we don&apos;t have a place to have a LOST mark. See GridDhtPartitionTopologyImpl::detectLostPartition.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16689451" author="sboikov" created="Fri, 16 Nov 2018 14:09:52 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;To fix this issue I changed TopologyImpl to store lost partitions in separate collection, this guarantee that once partition became lost it can be reset&#160;only by&#160;resetLostPartitions call. After this change&#160;leftNode2Part&#160;is not needed anymore&#160;(it was added&#160;to prevent duplicated &apos;lost partition&apos; events).&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Changes implemented in branch ignite-10044.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
